  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Hosting.Abstractions,GFX 能力组件机制契约:能力 manifest(必选/可选依赖/Options 根类型)/三段生命周期模块契约/桥与钩子槽位/服务注册描述符/能力族契约/事件总线契约/装配过滤器/能力报告. Capability hosting mechanism contracts for the GFX capability packages: manifests with required/optional dependencies and options root types, three-phase module lifecycle, bridge and hook slots, service registration descriptors, capability family contracts, event bus contracts, assembly filter and capability report types. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
